    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Henri, un jeune acteur qui r\u00eave de jouer dans Fast & Furious, se retrouve engag\u00e9 dans le film de C\u00e9dric Rov\u00e8re, monstre sacr\u00e9 du cin\u00e9ma d\u2019auteur. Les conditions du tournage ne sont pas tout \u00e0 fait celles auxquelles il s\u2019attendait\u2026 Mais le charme de sa partenaire et la bienveillance du ma\u00eetre vont faire na\u00eetre en lui des sentiments jusqu\u2019alors inconnus. Et Rov\u00e8re, conquis par la jeunesse et la fantaisie d\u2019Henri, vivra ce tournage comme un cadeau inattendu.",
        "english": "Henri is a young actor who dreams of playing in Fast & Furious but who finds himself cast in a movie by the legendary independent filmmaker C\u00e9dric Rov\u00e8re. Even if the conditions during the shoot aren\u2019t quite what Henri expected, he is won over by the charms of his on-screen partner and the generosity of the master filmmaker, and emerges transformed by the experience. Rov\u00e8re is also won over by Henri\u2019s eager imagination and youthful spirit, and views the film shoot as an unexpected gift."
